  <metadata>
    <name>Očnjak</name>
    <desc>A rocky hiking trail 0.9 km long with 302 m of ascent leads to the summit of Očnjak in Prokletije National Park. It passes two viewpoints and takes about 1 h 5 min without breaks. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
